OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash between
OL,4,Amotorbike and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash between a
OL,7,Fmotorbike and a car, police have said.
OL,9,FThe crash happened on the B3181 near
OL,10,FCullompton, Devon, at about 12:45 BST
OL,11,Fon Saturday, officers said.
OL,13,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a
OL,14,Fmotorbike rider, a man in his 50s,
OL,15,Fsuffered serious injuries and was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe road was closed for about eight
OL,19,Fhours for an investigation, said the
OL,20,Fforce.
